        "TASK18_ADMIN_MESSAGES_ENABLED": "true",
        "TASK20_ANDROID_APP_ENABLED": "true",
        "TASK21_NOTIFICATION_READS_ENABLED": "true",
        "TASK21_NOTIFICATION_WRITES_ENABLED": "true",
        "TASK22_TRANSFER_READS_ENABLED": "true",
        "TASK22_TRANSFER_WRITES_ENABLED": "true",
        "ANDROID_LATEST_VERSION_CODE": "12",
        "ANDROID_LATEST_VERSION_NAME": "1.2.9",
        "ANDROID_MINIMUM_VERSION_CODE": "1",
        "ANDROID_DOWNLOAD_URL": "",
        "ANDROID_RELEASE_DATE": "2026-09-12",
        "ANDROID_RELEASE_BUILD": "2026-09-12-task24-1-screenshot-r4",
        "ANDROID_RELEASE_NOTES": "截图归档修复：三星连续截图不再只保留第一张，每张截图都会独立保存并显示本机图片；系统通知没有携带图片时从系统相册补齐；Android 14–16 照片读取权限状态真实显示（完整读取 / 仅部分照片 / 未开启），读不到的截图明确显示「图片内容不可用」；同一张截图不会重复登记。保留 1.2.8 的待确认交易统一数据源、微信本地 OCR 与通知媒体历史能力。",
